@host = https://localhost:7247

### Alle Checklisten
GET {{host}}/api/checklists

### Eine Checkliste
GET {{host}}/api/checklists/1

### Item in einer Checkliste
GET {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items/1

### Item anlegen
POST {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Powerbank",
  "description": "20000 mAh",
  "quantity": 2
}